 "VaR是\u0001%置信水平的损失阈值；ES是最严重\u0001%尾部的平均损失。绿色深色部分按精确尾部概率分摊。 每根柱子表示该损失范围的历史出现情况，右侧深色表示最严重尾部。VaR不是最多只会亏这么多，ES不是另一个分位阈值。": "VaR is the loss threshold at the \u0001% confidence level; ES is the average loss in the worst \u0001% tail. The darker green area is allocated by exact tail probability. Each bar shows how often losses fell in that range and the darker right-hand side marks the worst tail. VaR is not the most you can lose, and ES is not another quantile threshold."
